Z||000014||fogglethorpe||10-07-2001||07:58 AM|||| <BLOCKQUOTE><font size="1" face="Verdana, Arial, Helvetica">quote:</font><HR>Originally posted by hugh:<BR><B>A 1/5 of a good whiskey will work real good.OH!Don't rub it on,drink it.You'll still hurt,you just won't care.</B><HR></BLOCKQUOTE><BR>Good advice...but this should be done AFTER doing the roof, not before. Otherwise, the next day will be spent marvelling at shingles that are sticky side up, even while you wonder why your left workboot is in the gutter. (That is if the fall didn't put you in the hospital)<P>||||reg||1
